d 'XTPMED': module to perform causal mediation analysis for balanced or unbalanced panel data with one or more mediators
d
d  xtpmed is a Stata command for panel causal mediation analysis
d using the Dynamic Fixed Effects (DFE) estimator within an
d ARDL(1,1)-ECM framework. It estimates direct, indirect and total
d effects while accounting for long-run relationships and dynamic
d adjustment mechanisms. 
d
d KW: causal mediation
d KW: panel data
d KW: ARDL
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261114
d
d Author:  Yusuf Toyin Yusuf,  Kwara State University
d Support: email  YUSUF.YUSUF@@KWASU.EDU.NG
d
d Author: Francis Baidoo, Koforidua Technical University
d Support: email ytoyinyusuf@@gmail.com
d
f xtpmed.ado
f xtpmed.sthlp
f xtpmed_cert_dynamic.dta
f xtpmed_cert_static.dta
f xtpmed_cert.do
f xtpmed_example.do
